  "description": "EffectGraph's engine as a static library, for a C++ program that needs more than the public API: the graph model, evaluator, effect registry, sources and display code with their headers, as ShaderLab uses them. Not a stable API: it changes with every version, so pin the version. x64 and ARM64, Debug and Release, built with MSVC v143 without /GL, so it links with Visual Studio 2022 and later. Includes every built-in effect's header. Most programs want EffectGraph.Native instead.",
  "id": "EffectGraph.Engine",
  "isPrerelease": false,
